'''Armor''' can be equipped at the [[Armory]] or in a [[Hellpod]] on the [[Bridge]] before [[Missions]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Most armor sets can be acquired by unlocking them through [[Warbonds]] with [[Medals]] or buying them from the [[Superstore]] using [[Super Credits]]. 

==Armory==
<tabber>
Armor=
Body armors come with designated [[Armor Passives|armor passive]] abilities and specific stats; they are categorized into light, medium, and heavy types.
There are a total of {{PAGESINCAT:Light Armor}} light, {{PAGESINCAT:Medium Armor}} medium, and {{PAGESINCAT:Heavy Armor}} heavy armors.
