Designated as [[Armor Passives#Standard Issue|standard issue]], helmets provide ''no additional bonuses''; they have no practical effect despite being rated at 100 for armor, speed, and stamina. However, if the worn body's armor rating exceeds 100, the wearer takes reduced headshot [[Damage#Armor Damage Modifiers|damage]] as well.
{{Helmet Grid}}

|-|Cape=
Capes, like helmets, are effectively [[Cosmetics#Cape-0|cosmetic]]. However, since they display stats in-game, they are categorized as armor.
