'''Stamina Regen''' (SR) is similarly calculated using these formulas:
 • If Armor Rating {{Tooltip|≥|greater-than or equal to}} 100
   ◦ Stamina Regen = 200 − Armor Rating
 • If Armor Rating {{Tooltip|<|less-than}} 100
   ◦ Stamina Regen = 150 − Armor Rating ÷ 2

